VERIFICATION

The packaged ragavan.exe was built from the source reference at:
https://github.com/chiefGui/ragavan/tree/{{SOURCE_REFERENCE}}

Build command:
cargo build --locked --release --package ragavan

The repository pins the Rust toolchain in rust-toolchain.toml and statically
links the Microsoft C runtime through .cargo/config.toml. To verify the packaged
executable, build that source reference with the command above and compare the
SHA-256 checksum.

